Dataplot commands and output:

reset data
reset i/o
reset plot control
set convert character on
skip 25
read linewid.dat day position x y
skip 0
let b0 = 0.2357
let b1 = 0.9870
let w = ((y - b0)/b1) - x
let sdcal = standard deviation w

> THE COMPUTED VALUE OF THE CONSTANT SDCAL  =  0.62036246E-01 
